        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong>First, please download the trial version to check if you can play the game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong> If you play for a long time, unintended sound effects will play. Please take a break and restart the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Changes from the trial version Your level will no longer decrease when you change weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Game System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the boat and defeat enemies with your shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your HP decreases when you are hit by enemies or bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your HP reaches zero, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >□ Green Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting them fills the green bar on the screen. When it’s full, you receive a skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Blue Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting them draws all &quot;□ Green&quot; items on the screen toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining skills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can obtain special weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or change existing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different combinations and enjoy experimenting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys or Numpad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S Key: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W Key: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D Key: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Key: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q Key: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F1 Key: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick/D-pad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Button: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B Button: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1 Button: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L1 Button: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Button: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select Button: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Strategy tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up even if you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you use bombs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you might be able to fight on with determination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After going out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atry finally returns home after a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as she's about to head out again,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her mother calls out and stops her.</p>",
