amepad Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick/D-pad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Button: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B Button: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1 Button: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L1 Button: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Button: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select Button: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Strategy tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up even if you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you use bombs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you might be able to fight on with determination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After going out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atry finally returns home after a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as she's about to head out again,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her mother calls out and stops her.</p>",
